lobbying_interests_prose:
As a lobbyist representing All Tech Tracking, I will focus on policies and legislative actions related to public safety technology, smart transportation systems, and automated enforcement within Wisconsin.

Specifically, my lobbying activities will include:

Supporting the implementation and regulation of red-light and speed camera programs to enhance roadway safety in Milwaukee and other municipalities;

Promoting technology-driven solutions that assist local and state agencies in improving traffic compliance and reducing accidents;

Advocating for data transparency, privacy protections, and equitable enforcement policies related to the use of automated tracking and public safety systems;

Encouraging public-private partnerships and funding opportunities that foster modernization of transportation and safety infrastructure;

Providing expertise on digital monitoring, analytics, and accountability systems to ensure responsible use of emerging technologies in public safety applications.

These efforts are intended to support the responsible expansion of technology that makes communities safer, while balancing innovation, privacy, and fairness in enforcement.
